# Synthetic values this repository uses on purpose: reserved example.com addresses,
# the made-up test numbers in tests/ and the playground, and pii_scan.sh's own
# header and checksum tables. Each line is a regular expression matched against
# "file:line:value" (see scripts/pii_scan.sh -h).
@example\.com
^\./scripts/pii_scan\.sh:
^\./tests/test_scripts\.sh:
9876543210$
